config BR2_PACKAGE_SHAREOS_ADGUARDHOME
	bool "shareos-adguardhome"
	depends on BR2_arm
	help
	  AdGuard Home for the system app "dnsfilter" (DNS filter module):
	  the official static linux_armv5 build, checked with its
	  SHA-256 – nothing is compiled.

	  https://github.com/AdguardTeam/AdGuardHome
